  "title": "More Biliterals",
  "short": "More common biliterals: zꜣ (pintail duck), kꜣ (raised arms), jr (eye), ms (fox skins), ḥm (club), mꜣ (sickle).",
  "trouble": "Students mix up the pintail duck (zꜣ) and other birds, or read the eye only as \"eye\". It writes the sound jr, as in jrj \"make\".",
